<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoLexerAdvance</function></refname>
  <refpurpose></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Lexer.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoLexerAdvance(SilikoLexer *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoLexerAdvance</function> function advances
<varname>object</varname> to its next token. If
<varname>object</varname> has reached the end of its input, further
calls to <function>SilikoLexerAdvance</function> on
<varname>object</varname> will have no effect, and
<function>SilikoLexerGetToken</function> will return a token indicating
the end of input has been reached.</para>
</refsection>
